---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our story | Manna Kitchen, Pretoria"
  description="The story of Manna Kitchen: two sisters in Theresapark, Pretoria, cooking frozen meals at home for seniors, people with disabilities and busy people.">

  <main class="about-page">
    <header class="hero">
      <h1>Our story</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="story" aria-labelledby="story-h">
      <h2 id="story-h">From hardship to hope</h2>
      <p>
        Manna Kitchen was born from both love and necessity. Two sisters, bound by family and
        faith, found themselves facing an unexpected challenge when one was diagnosed with
        Guillain-Barré syndrome, a rare neurological condition that required extensive medical
        treatment and ongoing care.
      </p>
      <p>
        What started as a way to generate revenue for medical expenses has blossomed into
        something far greater. From their home kitchen in Theresapark, Pretoria, these sisters began
        cooking the food they grew up with, made with care.
      </p>
      <p>
        Word spread quickly among neighbours and friends. People did not just come back for the
        food; they came back for the care woven into every dish, the personal touch in every
        interaction, and the knowledge that their purchase was helping a family in need.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today the kitchen cooks one thing: frozen meals, for people who would rather not cook
        every day. That includes older people, people living with a disability, and busy people
        who want help with meal planning. We have not forgotten our roots, and every meal still
        comes from that same home kitchen.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="special" aria-labelledby="special-h">
      <h2 id="special-h">What makes Manna special</h2>
      <ul class="special-points">
        <li>
          <h3>Cooked by hand at home</h3>
          <p>
            Every meal is made in our own kitchen in Theresapark, with the same care we would
            give to feeding our own family.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Made for easy days</h3>
          <p>
            Stock the freezer once and heat a meal when you need one. It takes the daily
            question of what to cook off your plate, or off a carer’s.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Supporting family</h3>
          <p>
            When you order from Manna Kitchen, you are supporting a family business with a
            heartfelt story.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
      <h2 id="how-h">How ordering works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <strong>Choose your meals</strong> from the menu and add them to your cart.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Choose delivery or pickup</strong> and a preferred date at least 2 business
          days ahead.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Send the order on WhatsApp.</strong> We confirm it with you, and quote the
          delivery fee if you chose delivery.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Pay by EFT or, when you collect, cash.</strong> We deliver in Pretoria, or you
          collect at 71 Springbok St, Theresapark.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="cta">
        Questions? <a href="https://wa.me/27825795210" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message us on WhatsApp</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem 3rem;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 2rem 0 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    min-width: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .special-points {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .special-points li {
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .special-points li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .special-points p { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .steps {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .steps li {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .steps strong { color: var(--ink); }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .cta a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .cta a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .cta a:active { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .cta a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--accent-ink);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-page { padding: 0.75rem 1rem 2.5rem; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  }
</style>
